title: The Captain finds you
from: Captain Odile Marrow
gist: On Saturday evening the Captain came to find you, to ask about the letter from headquarters.
== lines
marrow: There you are. I've walked two decks. Vance timed me.   [laugh]
marrow > you: It's half seven on Saturday. I said eight. I'm early, because I'm curious. Forgive me.
marrow > you: Headquarters, or the Wren? Or are you still thinking? That's an answer too.   [listen]
